# The Docker build context is the repo root (build/Dockerfile is built with
# `docker build -f build/Dockerfile .` or via buildstockbatch's aws.base_dockerfile).
# The Dockerfile only COPYs resources/Gemfile from the context, so exclude
# everything else to keep the context small (the repo contains many GB of
# git history, bundled gems, and container images).
*
!resources/Gemfile
